---
permalink: explore/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#101c2a">
    <title>The Gallery — {{ site.title }}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A winding gallery of 41 frames for Jane.">
    {% if isStaging %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">{% endif %}
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.canonicalOrigin }}/explore/">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/explore.css' | url }}">
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="experience" id="experience" data-base-path="{{ '/' | url }}" data-room-version="{{ galleryRoomVersion }}" data-music-url="{{ '/assets/explore/resolutions-scott-buckley.mp3' | url }}?v={{ exploreMusicVersion }}">
      <div class="scene" id="scene" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="topbar">
        <a class="site-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}" aria-label="Return to 13 Times 3">13 Times 3</a>
        <div class="topbar-right">
          <span class="section-status" id="section-status" aria-live="polite">Gallery 1 / 5</span>
          <button class="music-button" id="music-button" type="button" aria-label="Turn music on" aria-pressed="false">Sound off</button>
          <button class="icon-button" id="help-button" type="button" aria-label="Show instructions">?</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="room-title" id="room-title" hidden></div>

      <div class="reticle" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="look-hint" id="look-hint" aria-hidden="true">Drag and hold to turn</div>
      <div class="joystick" id="joystick" aria-label="Move through the gallery">
        <div class="joystick-ring"><div class="joystick-knob" id="joystick-knob"></div></div>
        <span>Move</span>
      </div>
      <div class="overlay" id="welcome" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
        <div class="welcome-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">For Jane · forty-one frames</p>
          <h1 id="welcome-title">Step into the in-between.</h1>
          <p>A winding hallway holds forty-one frames. Frames 01–06 open into memories of Zephrine's first stage, Jane's support during Oleg's job search, friendship, a blue-car walk, Jane's office move, and a tender ending. Frame 09 opens into a first apple-picking visit with friends. The other frames are still waiting.</p>
          <p>Walk through a finished painting to explore its frozen scene, then turn around and walk through the gold-edged doorway to return to the gallery.</p>
          <p class="control-note"><strong>On your phone:</strong> move with the joystick. Drag anywhere else on the scene and hold left or right to keep turning; lift to stop. Drag up or down to look. <strong>On a computer:</strong> use W A S D or arrow keys and drag to look.</p>
          <p class="music-note">Music fades in when you begin. Use Sound to turn it off or on.</p>
          <button class="primary-button" id="begin-button" type="button">Begin walking <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <a class="back-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}">Back to the site</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fallback" id="fallback" hidden>
        <div class="fallback-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">The gallery</p>
          <h1>The gallery is waiting.</h1>
          <p>This browser could not open the 3D hallway. Frames 01–06 and 09 are finished paintings; the other frames are waiting.</p>
          <div class="fallback-previews">
            {% for frame in gallery.frames %}{% if frame.room.modelUrl %}
              <figure><img class="fallback-preview" src="{{ frame.room.previewImage | url }}?v={{ galleryRoomVersion }}" alt="{{ frame.room.caption }}"><figcaption>{{ frame.room.caption }}</figcaption></figure>
            {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          </div>
          <ol class="frame-list">{% for frame in gallery.frames %}<li>{% if frame.room.modelUrl %}{{ frame.room.caption }}{% else %}{{ frame.label }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ol>
          <button class="retry-button" type="button" onclick="window.location.reload()">Try again</button>
          <a class="primary-button" href="{{ '/' | url }}">Return to 13 Times 3</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only" id="announcement" aria-live="polite"></span>
    </main>
    <script type="application/json" id="gallery-data">{{ gallery | serializeJson | safe }}</script>
    <script type="module" src="{{ '/assets/explore/app.js' | url }}?v={{ exploreScriptVersion }}"></script>
  </body>
</html>
